{"id":"4416b3038a7c4e6d9fd450841f19a302","model":"gpt-oss-120b","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"answer\": \"Escanaba Firing Line is a Michigan rock band formed in 2002 that has issued limited‑edition live albums such as Live at Short’s (2006) and Live at The Belmont (2010), both offered as free downloads. Dashboard Confessional is an American emo/alternative act whose 2002 live album MTV Unplugged 2.0 was certified platinum and reached #111 on the Billboard 200, and the band released radio singles “Rooftops and Invitations” (August 2006) and “Don’t Wait” (May 2006).\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    [\"Escanaba Firing Line\", 0],\n    [\"Live at Short's 2005\", 0],\n    [\"Live at Short's 2005\", 1],\n    [\"Live at the Belmont\", 0],\n    [\"Live at the Belmont\", 1],\n    [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\", 0],\n    [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\", 1],\n    [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\", 3],\n    [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\", 5],\n    [\"Rooftops and Invitations\", 0],\n    [\"Rooftops and Invitations\", 2],\n    [\"Don't Wait (Dashboard Confessional song)\", 0],\n    [\"Don't Wait (Dashboard Confessional song)\", 3]\n  ]\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to answer the question: \"Comparison between Dashboard Confessional and Escanaba Firing Line?\" Using evidence. Provide concise answer, nonempty string, with citations list of [title, sentence index] pairs.\n\nWe need to compare the two bands based on evidence: Escanaba Firing Line: formed 2002 in Michigan, limited-edition live albums (Live at Short's 2006, Live at The Belmont 2010), free downloads. Dashboard Confessional: live album MTV Unplugged 2.0 released 2002, first live album, platinum certification, chart positions (#111 Billboard 200, #1 Heatseekers, #1 Independent), singles \"Rooftops and Invitations\" and \"Don't Wait\" released to radio in 2006.\n\nThus answer: Escanaba Firing Line is a Michigan rock band formed in 2002, known for limited‑edition live recordings released as free downloads (Live at Short’s 2006, Live at The Belmont 2010). Dashboard Confessional is an American emo/alternative band whose 2002 live album MTV Unplugged 2.0 was certified platinum and charted on Billboard, and they released radio singles such as “Rooftops and Invitations” and “Don’t Wait” in 2006. Provide citations.\n\nWe need to cite each claim: formation: Escanaba Firing Line sentence 0. Live albums: Live at Short's sentence 0 and 1, Live at The Belmont sentence 0 and 1. Dashboard Confessional: MTV Unplugged 2.0 sentence 0,1,3,5 maybe. Singles: Rooftops and Invitations sentence 0,2; Don't Wait sentence 0,3.\n\nLet's list citations:\n\n- [\"Escanaba Firing Line\",0] for formation.\n- [\"Live at Short's 2005\",0] for third live album.\n- [\"Live at Short's 2005\",1] for release date 2006.\n- [\"Live at the Belmont\",0] for fourth live album.\n- [\"Live at the Belmont\",1] for release date 2010.\n- [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\",0] for live album release 2002.\n- [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\",1] for first live album.\n- [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\",3] for platinum certification.\n- [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\",5] for Billboard #111.\n- [\"Rooftops and Invitations\",0] for single.\n- [\"Rooftops and Invitations\",2] for radio release Aug 29 2006.\n- [\"Don't Wait (Dashboard Confessional song)\",0] for single.\n- [\"Don't Wait (Dashboard Confessional song)\",3] for radio release May 23 2006.\n\nWe can combine some but need at least one citation per claim. Provide list.\n\nNow produce JSON with answer and citations."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1218,"completion_tokens":923,"total_tokens":2141,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791969219,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}